@startuml
title FootTech — Diagramme de classes — 06 classes ia composition
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1565C0
  FontColor #263238
  ArrowColor #455A64
}
class LineupController {
  +generateRecommendation()
  +getRecommendations()
  +confirmLineup()
}
class LineupClient {
  +recommend(payload)
  +timeout: 5s
}
class RecommendationUseCase {
  +execute(players, weights)
}
class ScoringService {
  +presenceScore()
  +performanceScore()
  +fatigueScore()
  +finalScore()
}
class "RecommandationIA\nai_lineup_recommendations" as Recommendation {
  +matchId: UUID
  +playerId: UUID
  +score: Decimal
  +suggestedRole: Role
}
class TrendUseCase {
  +detect(points)
}
class ClusteringUseCase {
  +cluster(players)
}
class ToneUseCase {
  +analyze(comment)
}
class TranscriptionUseCase {
  +transcribe(audio)
}
class DocumentExtractionUseCase {
  +extract(image)
}
LineupController --> LineupClient
LineupClient --> RecommendationUseCase
RecommendationUseCase --> ScoringService
RecommendationUseCase --> Recommendation
note bottom
US-34 à US-37 et US-55 à US-59.
Le coach conserve la décision finale ; les services IA sont remplaçables.
end note
@enduml
